  26:ego.c         ****  * This code performs several functions related to the Yuneec E-GO electric
  27:ego.c         ****  * skateboard:
  28:ego.c         ****  *
  29:ego.c         ****  *  - connection following
  30:ego.c         ****  *  - continuous RX on a single channel
  31:ego.c         ****  *  - jamming
  32:ego.c         ****  */
